## 7. To reproduce the final results from scratch

```bash
python scripts/prepare_data.py
python scripts/run_final_all_models_v2.py          # ~15+ hours total across 4 models
python scripts/make_supp_best_fit_table.py
python scripts/make_supp_prior_table.py
python scripts/make_bayesian_model_fits_figure.py
python scripts/final_transmission_dynamics.py       # point at final_model_comparison_v2
python scripts/check_spillover_reseeding_robustness.py
python scripts/sweep_gamma_reseeding_falsification.py
```